<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Panavision started at buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Panavision started at buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen said analyst Hal Vogel started coverage of Panavision Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The company went public late in November at an IPO price of $17 a share.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/8 to 21-7/8.</p>
</text>
